        "code": "快速排序\nint quick(int l,int r){\n    int p=a[l],i=l,j=r;\n    while(i<j){\n        while(j>i && a[j]>p) j--;\n        while(i<j && a[i]<=p) i++;\n        swap(a[i],a[j]);\n    }\n    swap(a[l],a[j]);\n    return j;\n}\n\n归并排序求逆序对\nwhile(i<=mid && j<=r){\n    if(a[i]<=a[j]) b[tot++]=a[i++];\n    else{\n        b[tot++]=a[j++];\n        ans=(ans+mid-i+1)%mod;\n    }\n}"
